  "articleContent": "<div><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1787068800000/nv7ezt03112gbesvf1-1787132179756.jpg\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\">\n<div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">Dear Rovers,</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-line=\"true\">Wuthering Waves Fan Creation Event \"Lamplight in Mirage, Sword's Resolve in Heart\" is now live! Post your work with hashtags <a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/WutheringWaves?src=hashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#WutheringWaves</a> and <a href=\"https://x.com/hashtag/WuWaFanart?src=hashtag_click\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#WuWaFanart</a> on X (Twitter)/Instagram/Facebook and fill out the form for a chance to win iPhone 17 Pro 512GB, Astrites and more!</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"3\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"4\" data-line=\"true\">Create your works of boundless imagination to present the world of Wuthering Waves!</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"5\" data-line=\"true\">Proceed to submit:</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"5\" data-line=\"true\"><a href=\"https://forms.gle/H8GMCKyCZTUkUSom9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://forms.gle/H8GMCKyCZTUkUSom9</a></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"5\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"5\" data-line=\"true\">\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">Content Requirement</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-line=\"true\">Create your own artwork about Wuthering Waves Version 3.6&nbsp;\"Lamplight in Mirage, Sword's Resolve in Heart\"&nbsp;\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"3\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"4\" data-line=\"true\">Whether it's an illustration of your beloved character, comical moments from your adventures, or difficult combos you've mastered&mdash;anything that aligns with the theme is eligible for submission. Share your artwork or video for a chance to win exciting prizes!</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"4\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"4\" data-line=\"true\">\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\"><strong>How to Submit</strong></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"2\" data-line=\"true\">Post your artwork on X (Twitter)/Instagram/Facebook with both hashtags #WutheringWaves and #WuWaFanart included.</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"3\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"4\" data-line=\"true\">Complete the submission form with your submission details. Once done, your submission will be considered successful.</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"5\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"6\" data-line=\"true\">*Please quote your post link with the right hashtags published publicly on the designated platforms.</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"7\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"8\" data-line=\"true\">Submission form:</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"8\" data-line=\"true\"><a href=\"https://forms.gle/H8GMCKyCZTUkUSom9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://forms.gle/H8GMCKyCZTUkUSom9</a></div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"8\" data-line=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"8\" data-line=\"true\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1787068800000/rud0arm4m2t8u8833v-1787132501415.jpg\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
